TASK 3. VISIONING AND CONDITIONS ASSESSMENT
The Visioning and Existing Conditions efforts will include development of graphically rich summaries
of the MPO’s current mobility network conditions and the project goals, objectives, and performance
measures.
Task 3.1. Data Collection and Mapping
CONSULTANT will prepare a base map of the study area (in a format capable of being imported into
the City’s GIS system) to document the existing conditions analysis and upon which all planning and
engineering decisions will be made. CONSULTANT will rely predominantly on available existing data
and resources provided by the MPO and its project partners.
Task 3.2. Plans and Policy Review
CONSULTANT will review mutually agreed to plans, policies, and standards that are relevant to the
MTP update. This task will provide a concise, written summary of planning efforts and projects that
inform the update to the MTP.
Exhibit A
